<!doctype html>
<html lang="zh-CN" data-eh-version="0.1">
  <head>
    <meta charset="utf-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1">
    <title>引用、代码与分割线</title>
    <script type="application/json" id="eh-meta">{"title":"引用、代码与分割线","created":"2026-11-22","tags":["代码"],"theme":"default"}</script>
    <script id="eh-runtime" src="./.ehtml/runtime.js" defer></script>
  </head>
  <body>
    <main id="eh-doc">
      <blockquote data-eh="q1">学而不思则罔，思而不学则殆。<br>— 《论语》</blockquote>
      <blockquote data-eh="q2">Simple things should be <em>simple</em>, complex things should be <strong>possible</strong>.</blockquote>
      <hr data-eh="r1">
      <pre data-eh="c1" data-lang="ts"><code>export function add(a: number, b: number): number {
  return a + b;
}
</code></pre>
      <pre data-eh="c2" data-lang="html"><code>&lt;p data-eh="b1"&gt;Hello &amp;amp; bye&lt;/p&gt;
</code></pre>
      <pre data-eh="c3"><code>没有语言标注的代码块
    保留缩进 4 spaces
	和制表符 tab
</code></pre>
      <pre data-eh="c4" data-lang="python"><code>def f(xs):
    return [x for x in xs if x &lt; 10]  # 中文注释
</code></pre>
      <hr data-eh="r2">
      <p data-eh="p1">代码块之后的段落。</p>
    </main>
  </body>
</html>
